Rootlight third-party notices

Rootlight is distributed under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0
only. The complete Rootlight license is bundled as LICENSE.

The release CycloneDX SBOM records the names, versions, sources, license
expressions, and dependency relationships of the Rust packages incorporated
into each platform artifact.

The local Web UI incorporates the exact npm dependency graph locked in
apps/rootlight-web/frontend/package-lock.json. The release bundle includes
licenses/rootlight-web-third-party-notices.txt, generated from that lockfile
and the license files carried by the exact installed packages. In particular,
the shipped @cosmos.gl/graph 3.4.0, React 19.2.8, and React DOM 19.2.8
packages each declare the MIT license. The generated notice
records a package declaration without inventing replacement text when an
upstream npm tarball omits its standalone license file.

The following Tree-sitter grammar crates omit a license file from their
published crate archives. Rootlight therefore bundles the exact license text
from each pinned upstream release under licenses/:

- tree-sitter-cpp 0.23.4
- tree-sitter-java 0.23.5
- tree-sitter-kotlin-ng 1.1.0
- tree-sitter-typescript 0.23.2

Their upstream repository, commit, license identifier, source URL, and
license-text checksum are pinned in adapters/grammars.lock.

The local tree-sitter-wgsl 0.0.9 binding retains the authored GPU for the Web
source, the separately referenced W3C Software and Document License and
GPU for the Web 3-Clause BSD License, and Tree-sitter MIT support-header
notice. The exact license texts and local modification notice are bundled
as licenses/tree-sitter-wgsl-0.0.9-*; original attribution and source
provenance are retained in the versioned grammar package.

The Unicode 16 XID tables retain the exact Unicode-3.0 notice separately as
licenses/Unicode-XID-16.0.0-LICENSE. This does not replace the notices for
Rootlight's other versioned Unicode data.

The unpublished tree-sitter-scheme-native-local 0.24.7-1 binding uses the
retained default reader from 6cdh/tree-sitter-scheme. Its exact upstream MIT
notice is bundled as licenses/tree-sitter-scheme-0.24.7-1-LICENSE. The retained
Tree-sitter runtime notice is included as licenses/tree-sitter-0.26.11-LICENSE.
Original authored sources, archive and provenance remain in the versioned
grammar package; the local binding version does not establish registry
distribution equivalence.
